from reachq.shortcut import build_shortcut_set_for_reachability</code></pre>
  <p><code>bfs_reachability</code> traverses the original graph. <code>parallel_bfs</code> accepts optional shortcut edges but currently executes a sequential traversal. The construction wrapper returns <code>(shortcuts, beta, realised_bound)</code>.</p>
